    "body": "Lovely! LGTM with a couple comments:\n- commit message needs to be updated to reflect the broader scope of the PR and the cleanup that has taken place so far and the scheme data issue being fixed\n- I don't understand what \"no platinum label yet\" means\n- Although the spec has been changing a bit, in general I think we prefer multi-word variable names like _URL string_ and _URL record_ instead of _urlString_ and _urlRecord_. But If you want to move toward the latter that's fine too.\n",
